  },
  "settings.key.capture_codec.help": "Capture video codec: ffv1, h264 or h265. All three are lossless (h264/h265 encode RGB directly; the usual yuv444p 'lossless' settings are not byte-exact for RGB input). ffv1 is the most widely playable; h264/h265 produce smaller files but in an RGB form some players reject",
