  "settings.key.capture_ffmpeg_pass2_args.help": "ADVANCED. Full ffmpeg argument list for the mux pass. 'default' uses the engine's command. Placeholders: {videoIn} {audioIn} {sampleRate} {audioCodecArgs} {output}. Leave EMPTY to skip muxing entirely: the encode pass output is published as-is and the recording has NO AUDIO",
